{"2958550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deeper", "steam_appid": 2958550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark with up to 6 players on an underwater adventure to uncover treasures, shipwrecks, resources, or forgotten creatures. You’ll also almost certainly find death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/84cf19217e1fe795b671b49cef9459b8.webp?t=1781122451\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/84cf19217e1fe795b671b49cef9459b8.poster.avif?t=1781122451\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.poster.avif?t=1781122451\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.webm?t=1781122451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.mp4?t=1781122451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Print your gear, assign roles, and craft a careful strategy. Or just charge in headfirst, whatever floats your submarine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/0fa0c1f57e0c9e6623efe9424950917e.webp?t=1781122451\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/0fa0c1f57e0c9e6623efe9424950917e.poster.avif?t=1781122451\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b8b9ab7aef9262b73fc5ebf6f22040aa.poster.avif?t=1781122451\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b8b9ab7aef9262b73fc5ebf6f22040aa.webm?t=1781122451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b8b9ab7aef9262b73fc5ebf6f22040aa.mp4?t=1781122451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from failed expeditions.  <br>And loot their equipment, it could prove useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/64c52a2b15db22a065d7dcdfa3ff0de3.webp?t=1781122451\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/64c52a2b15db22a065d7dcdfa3ff0de3.poster.avif?t=1781122451\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/d765e49eeebaf305044e29eef514295b.poster.avif?t=1781122451\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/d765e49eeebaf305044e29eef514295b.webm?t=1781122451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/d765e49eeebaf305044e29eef514295b.mp4?t=1781122451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your teammates have gone silent, and a menacing shadow looms. Muster all your courage and throw it as a distraction while you make a break for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re still alive, dive back in deeper.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark with up to 6 players on an underwater adventure to uncover treasures, shipwrecks, resources, or forgotten creatures. You’ll also almost certainly find death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/84cf19217e1fe795b671b49cef9459b8.webp?t=1781122451\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/84cf19217e1fe795b671b49cef9459b8.poster.avif?t=1781122451\" class=\"bb_img\" width=630 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.poster.avif?t=1781122451\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.webm?t=1781122451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958550/extras/b61d691b71c7a75fa63563845c57e09b.mp4?t=1781122451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Print your gear, assign roles, and craft a careful strategy. Or just charge in headfirst, whatever floats your submarine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a